      "id": "claim_29c66821892c4683bbf145a74e37f7a1",
      "statement": "Engine construction is fail-fast: DB, Bus, Prov, Perm, and Tools are required dependencies, so a miswired dependency is a construction error rather than a nil panic inside an un-recovered turn goroutine that would crash the single binary.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/session/engine.go#L91-L106",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:710a3a83fb14c5b7e1fc408b01a7fa6630f590b0bb34bf59a5504ae9a7ffbb97:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_83fe145363374c76b8c7688b45a9d373",
      "statement": "Send loads the session row, resolves the provider/model ref, registers the session in the busy map (a second Send for the same session returns ErrSessionBusy), persists the user message and text part with message.updated and message.part.updated events, and spawns the turn goroutine.",
      "evidence": [
