      "statement": "Context overflow is detected by usage (round input exceeding model.Context) or by API error via a byte-faithful port of opencode's curated classifier: 27 case-insensitive overflow patterns with rate-limit exclusions (AND-NOT), plus status rules (413 always, 400/413 with empty body, or body error.code == context_length_exceeded); overflow stops the turn idle with a synthetic note and v1 has no compaction.",
