    {
      "id": "claim_c749cd9beae54365beba65f8c5953b0e",
      "statement": "Tool execution runs through the LOCKED gate sequence: doom check (sliding window on the turn's sha256-of-canonical-args call history; the third identical call asks a doom_loop permission before the part goes running), hidden guard (wildcard-denied tools are not offered to the model; calling one anyway errors \"tool not available\"), external-directory gate (one ask per outside directory pattern), then the core ask with Resources/Always from tool.Patterns; every gate path finalizes the part (deny -> \"permission rejected\", parked abort -> \"aborted\").",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/session/tool_exec.go#L174-L281",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0995880aaba19b409ab3c8ae0fc94a2f1ef498b673af8064c87bcc1e293dfad8:"
